     "author": {
      "accountId": "5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I see two references to it",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/rdf/impl/AclRdfContext.java#L57"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/rdf/impl/AclRdfContext.java#L57",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-commons/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/commons/responses/ViewHelpers.java#L202"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-commons/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/commons/responses/ViewHelpers.java#L202",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Apparently `fedora:writable` controls if the “Update Content” panel appears in the html ui.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It also appears to be telling us if modeshape is giving any of the following permissions “add_node,set_property,remove”. That seems a little out dated given that we are not relying on modeshape permissions anymore. I’m not sure if others feel that it is still necessary to provide a triple that tells the user if they can write to a resource, but the current implementation is inaccurate. We will probably need to update how the “Update Content” panel gets rendered too if I’m reading things correctly (edited)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
