       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "2018-11-12T18:04:02.274-0400"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:4cbd1cac-35ff-460e-a296-7f84d2cbc967",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/be7c7dc994e3e4d444fe0c6473628654?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPE-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/be7c7dc994e3e4d444fe0c6473628654?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPE-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/be7c7dc994e3e4d444fe0c6473628654?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPE-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/be7c7dc994e3e4d444fe0c6473628654?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPE-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Peter Matthew Eichman",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A4cbd1cac-35ff-460e-a296-7f84d2cbc967",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "My feeling is that we should figure out a way to fix ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "code"
           }
          ],
          "text": "fedora:writable",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " so a client application or a user can know in advance if they can write to a resource. Also, with the support of ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "code"
           }
          ],
          "text": "acl:Appends",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " mode in WebAC, should we think about adding a ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "code"
           }
          ],
          "text": "fedora:appendable",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " triple as well, to differentiate these two use cases?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "As an alternative, if there was a way for the resource to return an HTTP header that indicates what modes the requesting user has permission on the current resource, that would help. Something like this for read-only access:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Access-Mode: <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read>",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "read/append (but not write):",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Access-Mode: <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read>,\r\n    <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Append>",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "read/append/write (but not control):",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Access-Mode: <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read>,\r\n    <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Append>,\r\n    <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Write>",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "all modes:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Access-Mode: <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read>,\r\n    <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Append>,\r\n    <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Write>,\r\n    <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Control>",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
